                    benign skin lesions.                                        
                    Validation Metric: 0.9185                                   
                                                                                
                    -------------------------------                             
                    Design: We can enhance the robustness                       
                    of our predictions by applying simple                       
                    test‐time augmentation (TTA): for each                      
                    validation image, we compute                                
                    predictions on both the original and a                      
                    horizontally flipped version, then                          
                    average their probabilities. This                           
                    requires minimal changes to the code                        
                    and typically yields a small but                            
                    consistent boost in AUROC. We will                          
                    implement TTA in our `predict()`                            
                    function and use it to evaluate the                         
                    validation set as well as any test set                      
                    for generating `submission.csv`.                            
