                    -------------------------------                             
                    Design: We can improve model                                
                    generalization by adding RandomErasing                      
                    to the training augmentation pipeline,                      
                    which randomly occludes patches during                      
                    training and encourages the network to                      
                    focus on broader contextual cues.                           
                    Specifically, we add                                        
                    torchvision.transforms.RandomErasing                        
                    after normalization in the                                  
                    train_transform. This small change has                      
                    been shown to reduce overfitting and                        
                    often yields a measurable boost in                          
                    validation AUROC.                                           
