                    successfully without any bugs. The                          
                    model was trained for 3 epochs on the                       
                    skin lesion dataset and achieved a                          
                    validation AUROC of 0.8185, indicating                      
                    a good ability to distinguish between                       
                    malignant and benign lesions. The                           
                    training loss decreased steadily over                       
                    epochs, showing effective learning.                         
