                    -------------------------------                             
                    Design: We can greatly speed up and                         
                    stabilize training by freezing the                          
                    ResNet18 feature extractor and only                         
                    fine‐tuning the final classification                        
                    layer, which reduces compute and avoids                     
                    potential DataLoader deadlocks by                           
                    lowering `num_workers`. We reinitialize                     
                    `model.fc`, freeze all other layers,                        
                    and only optimize the head’s                                
                    parameters. This lets us train in just                      
                    a few seconds per epoch, print the                          
                    validation AUROC, and still provide a                       
                    reusable `predict()` function.                              
