                    color jitter—varying brightness,                            
                    contrast, saturation, and hue—to better                     
                    simulate real‐world lighting variations                     
                    and improve generalization.                                 
                    Specifically, we add                                        
                    T.ColorJitter(brightness=0.2,                               
                    contrast=0.2, saturation=0.2, hue=0.1)                      
                    into the existing train_transform                           
